sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant Runner as Self-hosted Runner
    participant Registry as Local Registry
    participant Argo as ArgoCD
    participant K8s as Minikube

    Dev->>GH: push or workflow_dispatch
    GH->>Runner: start Block 2 workflow
    Runner->>Runner: helm template
    Runner->>Registry: Kaniko build and push images
    Runner->>GH: update Helm image tags
    Runner->>Argo: sync block2-root
    Argo->>K8s: sync platform, data, apps
    K8s-->>Dev: updated local stand
